-- vw_artifact_handoffs_closure: Transitive closure of artifact hand-offs (FromStep -> ToStep), materialized as vw_artifact_handoffs_closure: every step an artifact can reach in one or more hand-offs.
-- Cycle-safe transitive closure of artifact_handoffs(from_step -> to_step) [junction edge table].
